<Legal title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for reef.support.">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website. It is built to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Text and background colours meet AA contrast ratios.</li>
    <li>Every page can be used with a keyboard, with a visible focus ring and a skip link to the main content.</li>
    <li>Pages use headings and landmarks so screen readers can move around them.</li>
    <li>The home page video plays without sound, can be paused, and does not play if your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
    <li>Layouts work from 360 px wide screens upward without sideways scrolling.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Report a problem</h2>
  <p>If something on this site does not work for you, tell us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and say which page and what went wrong.</p>
</Legal>
